## Development

Prerequisites: [task](https://taskfile.dev/) and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/). uv runs the offline checks in `bin/` and the
Claude Code hooks in `.claude/hooks/` through their script headers, and it runs cmemc: every task that
talks to Corporate Memory uses the cmemc release pinned in `Taskfile.yaml` (`CMEMC_VERSION`), not an installed
cmemc, so that a package is never built or published with a development version. Use `task cmemc -- <args>`
for cmemc commands no task wraps. To run another cmemc on purpose, set e.g. `CMEMC=cmemc` in `.env`.

- Run [task](https://taskfile.dev/) to see all major development tasks.
